<div id="q-required-resources" class="question" data-requirement-id="SE-6b">
  {# __tr_block_0000:start #}<h3>15. 將投入哪些資源（例如經費與時間）進行資料管理，並確保資料符合 FAIR（可被找到、可被取用、可相互操作、可再次使用）原則？</h3>{# __tr_block_0000:end #}

  <div class="answer">
    {# additional expertise #}
    {%- set expertisePath = [uuids.adminDetailsCUuid, uuids.additionalExpertiseQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set expertiseAUuid = repliesMap[expertisePath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- if expertiseAUuid == uuids.additionalExpertiseNoAUuid -%}
      {# __tr_block_0001:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise" data-status="explicit-no">執行資料管理方案不需要額外的專業知識。</p>{# __tr_block_0001:end #}
    {%- elif expertiseAUuid == uuids.additionalExpertiseYesAvailableAUuid -%}
      {# __tr_block_0002:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise" data-status="complete">執行資料管理方案需要額外的專業知識，且我們已有受過相關訓練的支援人員。</p>{# __tr_block_0002:end #}
    {%- elif expertiseAUuid == uuids.additionalExpertiseYesTrainAUuid -%}
      {%- set expertiseTrainPath = [expertisePath, uuids.additionalExpertiseYesTrainAUuid, uuids.additionalExpertiseYesTrainTrainingQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set expertiseTrainText = repliesMap[expertiseTrainPath]|reply_str_value -%}
      <div class="answer-lead">{# __tr_block_0003:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise" data-status="{# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgJ2NvbXBsZXRlJyBpZiBleHBlcnRpc2VUcmFpblRleHQgZWxzZSAncGFydGlhbCcgfX0= #}{% if expertiseTrainText %}{{ 'complete' }}{% else %}{{ 'partial' }}{% endif %}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #}">為補足所需的專業能力，本計畫將安排現有人員接受培訓。</p>{# __tr_block_0003:end #}</div>
      {% if expertiseTrainText %}
        <div class="answer-detail" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise-detail" data-status="complete">
          {{ expertiseTrainText|markdown }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      {%- if not expertiseTrainText -%}
        {# __tr_block_0004:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise-detail" data-status="missing">尚待補充：既有工作人員的培訓內容。</p>{# __tr_block_0004:end #}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elif expertiseAUuid == uuids.additionalExpertiseYesHireAUuid -%}
      {%- set expertiseHirePath = [expertisePath, uuids.additionalExpertiseYesHireAUuid, uuids.additionalExpertiseYesHireExpertiseQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set expertiseHireText = repliesMap[expertiseHirePath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {# __tr_block_0005:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise" data-status="{# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgJ2NvbXBsZXRlJyBpZiBleHBlcnRpc2VIaXJlVGV4dCBlbHNlICdwYXJ0aWFsJyB9fQ== #}{% if expertiseHireText %}{{ 'complete' }}{% else %}{{ 'partial' }}{% endif %}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #}">本計畫需要額外的專業知識，將招募新進人員。</p>{# __tr_block_0005:end #}
      {% if expertiseHireText %}
        <div class="answer-detail" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise-detail" data-status="complete">
          {# __tr_block_0006:start #}<p><strong>擬招募的專業知識</strong></p>{# __tr_block_0006:end #}
          {{ expertiseHireText|markdown }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      {%- if not expertiseHireText -%}
        {# __tr_block_0007:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise-detail" data-status="missing">尚待補充：新進人員應具備的專業知識。</p>{# __tr_block_0007:end #}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {# __tr_block_0008:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="specialist-expertise" data-status="missing">尚待補充：是否需要額外的專業知識。</p>{# __tr_block_0008:end #}
    {%- endif -%}
    {# additional hw/sw #}
    {%- set additionalHWSWPath = [uuids.adminDetailsCUuid, uuids.additionalHWSWQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set additionalHWSWAUuid = repliesMap[additionalHWSWPath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- if additionalHWSWAUuid == uuids.additionalHWSWNoAUuid -%}
      {# __tr_block_0009:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="hardware-software" data-status="explicit-no">除機構通常提供的資源外，我們不需要其他硬體或軟體。</p>{# __tr_block_0009:end #}
    {%- elif additionalHWSWAUuid == uuids.additionalHWSWYesAUuid -%}
      {%- set additionalHWSWWhatPath = [additionalHWSWPath, uuids.additionalHWSWYesAUuid, uuids.additionalHWSWYesWhatQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set additionalHWSWWhat = repliesMap[additionalHWSWWhatPath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if additionalHWSWWhat -%}
        <div class="answer-detail" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="hardware-software" data-status="complete">
          {# __tr_block_0010:start #}<p><strong>所需的額外硬體或軟體</strong></p>{# __tr_block_0010:end #}
          {{ additionalHWSWWhat|markdown }}
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        {# __tr_block_0011:start #}<p data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="hardware-software" data-status="partial">除機構通常提供的資源外，我們還需要其他硬體或軟體。</p>{# __tr_block_0011:end #}
        {# __tr_block_0012:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="hardware-software-detail" data-status="missing">尚待補充：所需的額外硬體或軟體。</p>{# __tr_block_0012:end #}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {# __tr_block_0013:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="hardware-software" data-status="missing">尚待補充：是否需要額外的硬體或軟體。</p>{# __tr_block_0013:end #}
    {%- endif -%}
    {# charges #}
    {%- set repoChargesPath = [uuids.preservingCUuid, uuids.repoChargesQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set repoCharges = repliesMap[repoChargesPath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- if repoCharges == uuids.repoChargesNoAUuid %}
      {# __tr_block_0014:start #}<p>預計使用的資料儲存庫不收取服務費。</p>{# __tr_block_0014:end #}
    {%- elif repoCharges == uuids.repoChargesYesAUuid %}
      {# __tr_block_0015:start #}<p>預計使用的資料儲存庫會收取服務費。</p>{# __tr_block_0015:end #}
    {%- else %}
      {# __tr_block_0016:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-fact-id="repository-charges" data-status="missing">尚待補充：是否需支付資料儲存庫服務費。</p>{# __tr_block_0016:end #}
    {%- endif %}
    {# costs #}
    {%- set projectPath = [uuids.adminDetailsCUuid, uuids.projectsQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set projectItems = repliesMap[projectPath]|reply_items -%}
    {%- if projectItems|length > 0 -%}
    {# __tr_block_0017:start #}<h4>資料管理預算</h4>{# __tr_block_0017:end #}
        {%- for i in projectItems -%}
            {%- set projectItem = [projectPath, i]|reply_path -%}
            {%- set projectItemNameQUuid = [projectItem, uuids.projectNameQUuid]|reply_path -%}
            {%- set projectItemNameReply = repliesMap[projectItemNameQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}

            {%- set projectItemNumberQUuid = [projectItem, uuids.projectNumberQUuid]|reply_path -%}
            {%- set projectItemNumberReply = repliesMap[projectItemNumberQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}
            <div class="project-resources" data-item-id="{{ projectItem }}">
                {% if projectItems|length > 1 %}{# __tr_branch_sentence_original:PHA-- #}{% if projectItemNameReply %}<p><strong>{# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgcHJvamVjdEl0ZW1OYW1lUmVwbHkgaWYgcHJvamVjdEl0ZW1OYW1lUmVwbHkgZWxzZSAiKG5vIG5hbWUgZ2l2ZW4pIiB9fQ== #}{{ projectItemNameReply }}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #}{{ " - " + projectItemNumberReply if projectItemNumberReply}} </strong></p>{% else %}{# __tr_block_0018:start #}<p><strong>（計畫名稱尚未提供）{{ " - " + projectItemNumberReply if projectItemNumberReply }}</strong></p>{# __tr_block_0018:end #}{% endif %}{# __tr_branch_sentence_original:end #}{% endif %}

                {%- set projectCostPath = [projectItem, uuids.costQUuid]|reply_path -%}
                {%- set projectCostItems = repliesMap[projectCostPath]|reply_items -%}

                {%- if projectCostItems|length > 0  -%}
                    <table class="resource-table">
                      <colgroup><col class="resource-purpose"><col class="resource-budget"><col class="resource-funding"></colgroup>
                      <thead><tr>{# __tr_block_0019:start #}<th scope="col">資源項目與用途</th>{# __tr_block_0019:end #}{# __tr_block_0020:start #}<th scope="col">預算</th>{# __tr_block_0020:end #}{# __tr_block_0021:start #}<th scope="col">經費來源</th>{# __tr_block_0021:end #}</tr></thead>
                      <tbody>
                    {%- for j in projectCostItems -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItem = [projectCostPath, j]|reply_path -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemTitleQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costTitleQUuid]|reply_path -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemTitleReply = repliesMap[projectCostItemTitleQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}
                        <tr data-item-id="{{ projectCostItem }}">{# __tr_block_0022:start #}<td>
                        <p><strong>{# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgcHJvamVjdENvc3RJdGVtVGl0bGVSZXBseSBpZiBwcm9qZWN0Q29zdEl0ZW1UaXRsZVJlcGx5IGVsc2UgIihubyByZXNvdXJjZSBuYW1lIGdpdmVuKSIgfX0= #}{% if projectCostItemTitleReply %}{{ projectCostItemTitleReply }}{% else %}（尚未填寫資源名稱）{% endif %}{# __tr_block_0022:end #}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #}</strong></p>
                        
                        {%- set projectCostItemDescriptionQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costDescriptionQUuid]|reply_path -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemDescriptionReply = repliesMap[projectCostItemDescriptionQUuid]|reply_str_value  -%}
                        
                        {%- if projectCostItemDescriptionReply -%}
                          <div class="answer-detail" data-fact-id="resource-justification" data-status="complete">{{ projectCostItemDescriptionReply|markdown }}</div>
                        {%- else -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0023:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resource-justification" data-status="missing">尚待補充：這項資源如何協助產出符合 FAIR 原則的資料。</p>{# __tr_block_0023:end #}
                        {%- endif -%}

                        {%- set projectCostItemCurrencyQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costCurrencyQUuid]|reply_path  -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemCurrencyReply = repliesMap[projectCostItemCurrencyQUuid] -%}


                        {%- set projectCostItemAmountQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costAmountQUuid]|reply_path   -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemAmountReply = repliesMap[projectCostItemAmountQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}

                        {%- set resourceBudget -%}
                        {%- if  projectCostItemAmountReply and projectCostItemCurrencyReply -%}
                            <p>{{projectCostItemAmountReply}} {{macros.integrationCurrency(projectCostItemCurrencyReply) }}</p>
                        {%- else -%}
                            {% if projectCostItemAmountReply %}
                              <p data-fact-id="resource-amount-value" data-status="complete">{{ projectCostItemAmountReply }}</p>
                            {% endif %}
                            {% if projectCostItemCurrencyReply %}
                              {# __tr_block_0024:start #}<p data-fact-id="resource-currency" data-status="complete">幣別：{{ macros.integrationCurrency(projectCostItemCurrencyReply) }}</p>{# __tr_block_0024:end #}
                            {% endif %}
                            {# __tr_branch_sentence_original:- #}{% if projectCostItemAmountReply %}{# __tr_block_0025:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resource-amount" data-status="missing">幣別尚未提供。</p>{# __tr_block_0025:end #}{% elif projectCostItemCurrencyReply %}{# __tr_block_0026:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resource-amount" data-status="missing">預算金額尚未提供。</p>{# __tr_block_0026:end #}{% else %}{# __tr_block_0027:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resource-amount" data-status="missing">預算金額與幣別尚未提供。</p>{# __tr_block_0027:end #}{% endif %}{# __tr_branch_sentence_original:end #}
                        {%- endif -%}
                        {%- endset -%}

                        {%- set projectCostItemAllocationQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costAllocationQUuid]|reply_path  -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemAllocationItems = repliesMap[projectCostItemAllocationQUuid]|reply_items -%}

                        
                          {%- set projectCostItemAllocations = [] -%}
                          {%- if uuids.costAllocationFindabilityAUuid in projectCostItemAllocationItems -%}{# __tr_block_0028:start #}
                          {%- do projectCostItemAllocations.append("資料可尋性") -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0028:end #}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if uuids.costAllocationAccessibilityAUuid in projectCostItemAllocationItems -%}{# __tr_block_0029:start #}
                          {%- do projectCostItemAllocations.append("資料可取用性") -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0029:end #}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if uuids.costAllocationInteroperabilityAUuid in projectCostItemAllocationItems -%}{# __tr_block_0030:start #}
                          {%- do projectCostItemAllocations.append("資料互通性") -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0030:end #}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if uuids.costAllocationReusabilityAUuid in projectCostItemAllocationItems -%}{# __tr_block_0031:start #}
                          {%- do projectCostItemAllocations.append("資料可再用性") -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0031:end #}{%- endif -%}
                          {%- if uuids.costManagementAUuid in projectCostItemAllocationItems -%}{# __tr_block_0032:start #}
                          {%- do projectCostItemAllocations.append("資料管理") -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0032:end #}{%- endif -%}
                        
                        {%- if projectCostItemAllocations|length > 0 -%}
                          {# __tr_branch_sentence_original:PHA- #}{%- if projectCostItemAllocations|length > 2 -%}{# __tr_block_0033:start #}<p>
                            支援項目：{{ projectCostItemAllocations[0:-1]|join("、") }}及{{ projectCostItemAllocations[-1] }}。
                          </p>{# __tr_block_0033:end #}{%- elif projectCostItemAllocations|length == 2 -%}{# __tr_block_0034:start #}<p>
                            支援項目：{{ projectCostItemAllocations[0] }}及{{ projectCostItemAllocations[1] }}。
                          </p>{# __tr_block_0034:end #}{%- else -%}{# __tr_block_0035:start #}<p>
                            支援項目：{{ projectCostItemAllocations[0] }}。
                          </p>{# __tr_block_0035:end #}{%- endif %}{# __tr_branch_sentence_original:end #}
                        {%- else -%}
                          {# __tr_block_0036:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resource-allocation" data-status="missing">尚待補充：這項資源將支援哪些 FAIR 或資料管理工作。</p>{# __tr_block_0036:end #}
                        {%- endif -%}
                       
 
                        </td><td>{{ resourceBudget }}</td>{# __tr_block_0037:start #}<td>
                        {%- set projectCostItemCoverQUuid = [projectCostItem, uuids.costCoverQUuid]|reply_path  -%}
                        {%- set projectCostItemCoverReply = repliesMap[projectCostItemCoverQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}

                        {%- if projectCostItemCoverReply == uuids.costCoverGrantAUuid -%}
                          {%- set costCoverGrantIdQUuid = [projectCostItemCoverQUuid, uuids.costCoverGrantAUuid, uuids.costCoverGrantIdQUuid]|reply_path -%}
                          {%- set costCoverGrantIdReply = repliesMap[costCoverGrantIdQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}
                          <p data-fact-id="cost-coverage" data-status="complete">這筆費用將由補助經費支應。</p>
                          {% if costCoverGrantIdReply %}
                            <p>補助編號：{{ costCoverGrantIdReply }}。</p>
                          {% else %}
                            <p class="data-gap" data-fact-id="grant-number" data-status="missing">尚待補充：補助編號。</p>
                          {% endif %}
                        {%- elif projectCostItemCoverReply == uuids.costCoverOtherAUuid -%}
                          {%- set costCoverOtherHowQUuid = [projectCostItemCoverQUuid,uuids.costCoverOtherAUuid, uuids.costCoverOtherHowQUuid]|reply_path  -%}
                          {%- set costCoverOtherHowReply = repliesMap[costCoverOtherHowQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}
                          {%- if costCoverOtherHowReply -%}
                            <div class="answer-detail">{{costCoverOtherHowReply|markdown}}</div>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="cost-coverage" data-status="missing">尚待補充：經費來源。</p>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        {%- else -%}
                          <p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="cost-coverage" data-status="missing">尚待補充：經費來源。</p>
                        {%- endif -%}


                        </td>{# __tr_block_0037:end #}</tr>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                {%- else -%}
                    {# __tr_block_0038:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resources-costing" data-status="missing">尚待補充：本計畫編列的資料管理資源，例如工作人員時間、儲存空間、寄存準備工作及資料儲存庫費用。</p>{# __tr_block_0038:end #}
                {%- endif -%}

            </div>

        {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {# __tr_block_0039:start #}<p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-6b" data-fact-id="resources-costing" data-status="missing">尚待補充：資料管理及落實 FAIR 原則所編列的經費與時間。</p>{# __tr_block_0039:end #}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
